<p>Hi there 👋</p>

<p>I noticed you cancelled your Pagecord subscription for <strong><%= link_to @blog.display_name, blog_home_url(@blog) %></strong>. Sorry to see you go!</p>

<% if @ends_on %>
  <p>Premium stays on until <strong><%= @ends_on %></strong>. After that, your blog carries on for free and nothing you've made is taken away, but Premium features like analytics, your newsletter and hiding the Pagecord branding switch off.</p>

  <% if @blog.custom_domain.present? %>
    <p>Your custom domain, <strong><%= @blog.custom_domain %></strong>, keeps working until <strong><%= @domain_ends_on %></strong>. After that, your blog goes back to its pagecord.com address.</p>
  <% end %>
<% end %>

<p>If you have a moment, I'd love to hear what didn't work for you – it really helps me improve Pagecord. You can resubscribe any time, and just reply to this email if there's anything I can help with.</p>

<%= image_tag "signature.jpg", style: "margin-top: 8px; text-align: left; width:120px;" %>

<p>Olly – creator of Pagecord</p>
